<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Pixel Push | Digital Marketing Services</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Pixel Push</h1>
    <p>Your brand's digital best friend.</p>
  </header>

  <section id="services">
    <h2>Our Services</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Social Media Management</strong> – Engage your audience and grow your brand.</li>
      <li><strong>Content Strategy</strong> – Captivating content that converts.</li>
      <li><strong>Brand Identity</strong> – Visuals and voice that reflect your vision.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics & Optimization</strong> – Measure, learn, and improve.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="testimonial">
    <h2>First Client Love 💬</h2>
    <blockquote>
      "Pixel Push helped bring clarity and consistency to my Instagram presence. Highly recommend!" – MJ, The Sacred Cocoon
    </blockquote>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <h2>Let's Connect</h2>
    <p>Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@pixelpush.marketing">hello@pixelpush.marketing</a></p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2025 Pixel Push. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  background-color: #f9f9f9;
  color: #333;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

header {
  background-color: #1e1e2f;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 60px 20px;
}

header h1 {
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  font-size: 2.5em;
}

section {
  padding: 40px 20px;
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: auto;
}

#services ul {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
}

#services li {
  margin-bottom: 15px;
  background: #ffffff;
  padding: 15px;
  border-left: 5px solid #4e54c8;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

blockquote {
  background: #eef;
  padding: 20px;
  font-style: italic;
  border-left: 5px solid #4e54c8;
}

footer {
  text-align: center;
  background: #1e1e2f;
  color: white;
  padding: 20px 10px;
}

